	Another corewar bug fix:

As written, the first program always wins whenever either hits an
illegal instruction. The bug is in execute:

Change (line 294)

	if ( -1 == (p1 = do_instruction(p1))) return 1;

to

	if ( -1 == (p1 = do_instruction(p1))) return 2;



